{"sha": "800a761d22b14dc3f675f698f99a4b8853fc3979d7376a686821913a1c9f79c1", "body": ["\\begin{example}[分数线中的分数线]\\label{ex:g8:fractions:complex}", "“双层分数”其实就是竖着写的除法：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\ }{\\ \\frac{5}{6}\\ }", "= \\frac{2}{3} \\div \\frac{5}{6}", "= \\frac{2}{3} \\times \\frac{6}{5}", "= \\frac{12}{15} = \\frac{4}{5}.", "\\]", "先找出\\emph{主}分数线（即最长的那条），再", "应用\\cref{thm:g8:fractions:div}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[混合运算]\\label{met:g8:fractions:mixed}", "在含有分数与四则运算的式子中：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 按通常的运算顺序进行（见\\cref{ch:g7:priorities}）；", "  \\item 将每个除法都化为乘以倒数；", "  \\item 先确定符号（见\\cref{met:g8:negprod:compute}），再", "        相乘或通分；", "  \\item 尽早约分。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:fractions:mixed}", "\\begin{align*}", "\\frac12 + \\frac{2}{3} \\times \\frac{9}{4}", "&= \\frac12 + \\frac{2 \\times 9}{3 \\times 4}", "&& \\text{（先算乘积！）} \\\\", "&= \\frac12 + \\frac{18}{12} = \\frac12 + \\frac32", "= \\frac{4}{2} = 2 .", "\\end{align*}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:1}", "计算并化简：", "\\[", "\\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{2}{5}, \\qquad", "\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{3}{8}, \\qquad", "\\frac{7}{10} + \\frac{8}{15} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:2}", "计算（先确定符号）：", "\\[", "-\\frac{2}{7} + \\frac{3}{14}, \\qquad", "\\frac{1}{6} - \\frac{5}{4}, \\qquad", "-\\frac{3}{5} - \\frac{1}{2} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:3}", "计算，相乘前先约分：", "\\[", "\\frac{5}{8} \\times \\frac{4}{15}, \\qquad", "\\frac{9}{14} \\times \\frac{7}{3}, \\qquad", "\\left(-\\frac{6}{5}\\right) \\times \\frac{10}{9} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:4}", "写出下列各数的倒数：$\\dfrac{3}{7}$；\\quad $5$；\\quad", "$\\dfrac{1}{4}$；\\quad $-\\dfrac{2}{9}$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:5}", "计算：", "\\[", "\\frac{4}{9} \\div \\frac{2}{3}, \\qquad", "\\frac{7}{5} \\div 14, \\qquad", "6 \\div \\frac{3}{4} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:6}", "计算下列“双层分数”：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\ \\frac{3}{4}\\ }{\\ \\frac{9}{8}\\ },", "\\qquad", "\\frac{\\ \\frac{5}{6}\\ }{\\ 10\\ },", "\\qquad", "\\frac{\\ 2\\ }{\\ \\frac{4}{7}\\ } .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:7}", "计算，注意运算顺序：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\frac{4}{5},", "\\qquad", "\\left(\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\times \\frac{4}{5} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:8}", "一个水箱装了 $\\frac{2}{5}$，再加入\\emph{水箱容积}的 $\\frac{1}{3}$。", "此时水箱中有几分之几是满的？", "还有几分之几是空的？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:9}", "某班有四分之三的学生通过了测验；在这些学生中，", "三分之二的人得分超过 $14$（满分 $20$）。全班中得分超过 $14$ 的", "人占几分之几？若这部分人数为 $12$ 人，则", "全班共有多少人？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g8:fractions:10}", "一根长 $\\frac{15}{2}$ 米的绳子，要剪成每段 $\\frac{3}{4}$ 米的", "小段。可以剪得几段？（这是分数除法——", "请检验结果是否为整数。）", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}